{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y的心理叙述压缩后偶尔改变了原意，例如S08的“却没想回头”比X的“暂时把回不回去的事放到一边”更确定，S09的“宁愿再受气”也把想有人陪伴的动机改得更尖锐。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的重点词突出，话语短而集中，感受又能随音乐进程逐步出现，观众更容易在听音乐时抓住每段重点；音乐表现的细节、情绪转折和质感也明显更丰富具体。X的优势是人物心理因果交代得更完整，尤其是舍不得、害怕孤独、不甘心受委屈之间的反复拉扯，过渡更自然，整体叙事也更稳妥。综合而言，Y的屏幕观看体验更好，但它牺牲了一部分心理解释的准确性和叙事细腻度。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "cf2b2a79-f816-4e4c-a24e-0df5f828511b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T225120527301Z", "elapsed_seconds": 34.875, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T22:51:55.425596+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "6001c79d599643a716bbe5f89a40da62a0f9ed9dc9724a329b496e344ae84f65", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tool